  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Urban Development Policy - Bridging Urban Policy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">National Urban Development Policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom beslut Ken 124/2009 beslutade Sida att st&#xF6;dja Ministeriet f&#xF6;r lokal f&#xF6;rvaltning (MoLG) i processen att ta fram en nationell urbanpolicy f&#xF6;r Kenya. Den totala budgeten f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;det till framtagande av Urbanpolicy &#xE4;r ca15 MSEK varav Sida betalar 12,5 miljoner kronor. Pengarna och genomf&#xF6;randet avser 2 &#xE5;r och kommer att anv&#xE4;ndas f&#xF6;r 2 r&#xE5;dgivare samt konsultationsprocessen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida decided through decision 124/09 to support MoLG in their process of formulating a national urban policy. The total budget is 15 MSEK, Sida contribution 12,5 over 2 years. The funds will be used for 2 longterm technical advisors and facilitation of the consultation process with workshops, information etc.</narrative>
  </description>
